  "title": "Mars Orbiter Mission (Mangalyaan)",
  "summary": "India's first interplanetary mission, Mangalyaan, was launched by ISRO on a PSLV rocket from Sriharikota on 5 November 2013. After a transit of about 300 days it entered Mars orbit on 24 September 2014 (23 September in UT per NASA), then operated for around eight years.",
